            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Chinese Patience: 2â€“4 player competitive patience. Shared foundation piles and tableau (four columns). Single-deck version of Russian Bank. First to dispose of all cards wins. Name is exotic only; not from China.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "England. Competitive patience; single-deck version of Russian Bank. Shared four foundations (Ace up in suit) and four tableau columns. Name 'Chinese' is exotic only.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '2, 3, or 4 (best 2â€“3). Play clockwise.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '52 cards, no Jokers. Rank K down to A for building.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "52-card deck; space for 4 foundations, 4 tableau columns, each player's stock and waste.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Four cards dealt to centre as tableau (face down, turned by first player); remainder dealt equally to players as face-down stocks.',
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
